        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let's go!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're a fool if you think you can defeat me!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "2": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So frustrating."
            ]
        }
    },
    "3": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Fufufu...so many souls on the surface,",
                "just waiting to be led into Hell."
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eh?"
            ]
        },
        "136_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What are you doing out of Hell!?"
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, Miss Reimu.",
                "I've been looking for you."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Gah, I've got a bad feeling about this...",
                "I'd better get out of here."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Fufufu.",
                "Do you truly think you can escape?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "4": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Guess it can't be helped...",
                "What do you want?"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Lady Zanmu humbly requests your presence."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And just why should I go along with that?"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Very well.",
                "Another match, then?"
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, <i$come on...>"
            ]
        }
    },
    "5": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'll make it worth your while..."
            ]
        }
    },
    "6": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I believe the sanctuary should be around here."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Are there any guides like me on the surface?",
                "I wonder."
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Y-you're..."
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The guide of Hell!",
                "You thought you could get away with tricking me?!"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Deciding where you should end up is",
                "one of my responsibilities as a guide."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Master Zanmu was mad at me for not showing up."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And it's because you didn't do your job!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "7": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If you want to meet Lady Zanmu,",
                "you're 10 years too early."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Tch..."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So, what are you doing here?"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I have good news for you today."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I will take you to meet Lady Zanmu."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh? First you say I'm 10 years too early,",
                "and now you say you're gonna bring me to her anyway..."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You Hell dwellers...",
                "You really just do whatever you want."
            ]
        }
    },
    "8": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ahh, that was refreshing."
            ]
        }
    },
    "9": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now then, who's next?"
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah! You're..."
            ]
        },
        "136_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...that guide from Hell?!"
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You didn't show me around properly the other day.",
                "I had a lousy time, you know!"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What makes a 'proper' guide ",
                "is a matter of personal opinion."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Shut it!",
                "If you're a guide, then act like one! That's all there is to it!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "10": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, I guess this is fine.",
                "I don't <i$need> to meet Master Zanmu."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm glad my guidance ended up helping you."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "By the way, why are you here?",
                "What's a guide from Hell doing on the surface?"
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I have good news for you today."
            ]
        },
        "36_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I will take you to meet Lady Zanmu."
            ]
        },
        "44_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<i$Huh?>",
                "What the heck are you..."
            ]
        },
        "52_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No, there's no point in getting mad.",
                "That's just how this place is. Nonsensical..."
            ]
        }
    },
    "11": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, I guess this is fine."
            ]
        }
    },
    "12": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "People have been calling that tenkajin",
                "a 'Chupacabra' lately, for some reason."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I can see why.",
                "It's a lovely name."
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Aah! You are..."
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...that yomotsu-shikome?",
                "Did I come to New Hell by mistake?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I've come to take you to Lady Zanmu."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh? What are you saying?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You really think I'm gonna buy a story like that?"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Besides, I don't think I want to meet her anymore."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hah! Do you think you can escape me?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "13": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'll never let you get away!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "All right, all right!",
                "We'll just meet up with Zanmu and that's it, right?"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's right.",
                "Don't be late this time."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You sent me the wrong way last time, though!"
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, did I?",
                "Fufufu."
            ]
        }
    },
    "14": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That was refreshing."
            ]
        }
    },
    "15": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ahh, what could Lady Zanmu need <i$this> person for?"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I really don't feel like giving this one a proper tour."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Maybe I'll just take her to that other oni again."
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hey, hey, don't do that!"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If you break one more promise, I'll bet",
                "even Zanmu's gonna get mad at you."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And I'd be annoyed as well."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, Miss Suika.",
                "How long have you been here?"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I've been watching to make sure you aren't",
                "just acting out on your own."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But it turns out you are.",
                "And that's good enough for me!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "16": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What's so wrong about doing what I want?"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, not much, really."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But she'll get angry with you."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Haa...",
                "Angry...you say?"
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I <i$want> her to be angry with me!",
                "Lady Zanmu!"
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...Oh, boy."
            ]
        }
    },
    "17": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hell really is the land of the self-indulgent."
            ]
        }
    },
    "18": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...haa...haa..."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "As promised, I've brought everyone here."
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "My apologies for the trouble."
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hisami, you may take a break."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Haa... haa..."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...what's the matter?",
                "You can leave now."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Um, aren't you going to scold me?"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hm? Scold you?"
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The truth is, I led the people you asked",
                "me to gather to another oni instead."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I humbly apologise for my actions.",
                "But regardless, surely you'll scold me for..."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hmph."
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Did you truly think you were acting of your own volition?"
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eh?"
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Your little transgression was part",
                "of my plan from the beginning."
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Everything rests in the palm of my hand."
            ]
        },
        "240_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Wha-",
                "That's...just what I was thinking!"
            ]
        },
        "248_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Either way, you'll be rewarded."
            ]
        },
        "256_0": {
            "lines": [
                "With the greatest prize this wretched Hell can offer!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "20": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hmph. That was pathetic."
            ]
        }
    }
